<title>USA: New Mexico $380 mln notes yield 3.85 pct.</title>
<headline>New Mexico $380 mln notes yield 3.85 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffray Inc. said Tuesday it tentatively priced $380 million New Mexico tax and revenue anticipation notes with a 4.50 percent coupon to yield 3.85 percent.</p>
<p>The notes, due on June 30, 1998, are rated MIG-1 by Moody's Investors Service and SP1-plus by Standard and Poor's Corp.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
